{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/20FoundationEssentials11FormatStyleP","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/Se","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/SE","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/SQ","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/SH","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that formats lists of items with a separator and conjunction appropriate for a given locale."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ListFormatStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"ListFormatStyle","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ListFormatStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"FoundationInternationalization"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","deprecated":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"12.0","beta":false,"name":"macOS"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"tvOS","deprecated":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","beta":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"externalID":"s:30FoundationInternationalization15ListFormatStyleV"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","